<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-GOLDMAN CUTS CHRISTIANIA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-GOLDMAN CUTS CHRISTIANIA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs cut its rating on Norway's Christiania Bank og Kreditkasse to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot;, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
